  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\"><!-- .entry-header -->\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><b><strong>Short Information :</strong></b>&nbsp;<a style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"https://dsssb.delhi.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Delhi Subordinate Service Selection Commission, DSSSB</a> </span>has released the DSSSB Admit Card / Hall Ticket / Call Letter / Exam Schedule for the Various Recruitment 2017, 2018, 2019, 2020, 2021, 2022, 2023, 2024, 2025 which will be held from 16 February 2026 to 14 May 2026.</span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"> The Candidates who have applied for these examination can check their Exam Date as well as download their admit card from the direct link which has been mentioned below.. </span></div>\n<div class=\"post-desc\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; height: auto !important;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"7\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Delhi Subordinate Service Selection Commission, DSSSB</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">DSSSB June Admit Card 2026</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"7\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Various Posts CBT Exam Date May :<strong> 01-24 April 2025, 06-08 &amp; 22 June 2025 Exam Schedule</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Various Posts CBT Exam Date June :<strong> 23 June 2025 to 09 July 2025 Exam Schedule</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Warder, Matron &amp; Assistant Superintendent PET / Skill Test :<strong> 26 May 2025 to 11 June 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">PET Admit Card Release Date : <strong>05 June 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: #ffffff;\">August / September Exam Schedule :<strong> 27 August 2025 to 15 September2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: #ffffff;\">September Exam Schedule :<strong> 22 – 26 September2025&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: #ffffff;\">October, November &amp; December Exam Schedule :<strong> 01 November 2025, to 15 December 2025&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">February &amp; March Month Exam Date : <strong>16 February 2026 to 14 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">June, July, August, September Exam Date&nbsp; : <strong>01 June 2026 to 01 September 2026</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"7\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Exam Details</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Exam Name :</strong> Delhi DSSSB Various Posts Recruitment 2025</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Exam Conduct&nbsp;:</strong> Delhi Subordinate&nbsp;Service Selection Board&nbsp;DSSSB Are Conducted the Various Recruitment Exam in Every&nbsp;<span id=\"IL_AD11\" class=\"IL_AD\">Year</span>.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"7\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>DSSSB Various Posts Exam Date / Admit Card 2026</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">As the DSSSB Various Posts Exam Date has released on the official website &amp; the Admit Card 2025 has also released online at the official website of DSSSB few days before the examination. For getting more information regarding DSSSB Various Posts Exam Date / Admit Card 2025, candidates need to maintain a frequent check on the Portal.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"7\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Instructions For Downloading The DSSSB Admit Card 2026</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Check the Important Links section below</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Open the Download Admit Card link</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">After that, a new page will be opened in which candidates have to provide Roll Number / Application Number &amp; DOB.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates are suggested to download the admit card &amp; save the pdf file for the future reference.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates can download the Admit Card also from the official website of Delhi Subordinate Service Selection Commission, DSSSB.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable2\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px; width: 56.1488%;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><strong>Join Telegram Channel</strong></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-soci