lign: center; padding: 10px 0;\"><strong><a href=\"https://t.me/sarkariresulinfo\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a></strong></h4>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tcell\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px; width: 56.1488%;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"56%\">\n<h4><span style=\"color: #800000;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></h4>\n</td>\n<td class=\"tcell\" style=\"width: 43.1174%;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"43%\">\n<h4 align=\"center\"><strong><a href=\"https://dsssb.delhi.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Click Here</a></strong></h4>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" style=\"width: 97.9167%;\" colspan=\"7\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Important Question</strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Q. Has the DSSSB Various Post Admit Card 2026 been released?<br></strong><strong>Answer. </strong>Yes the DSSSB Various Post Admit Card has been released.</span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Q. When was the DSSSB Various Post Admit Card released?<br></strong><strong>Answer. </strong>The DSSSB Various Post Admit Card was released on <strong data-start=\"427\" data-end=\"450\">22 April 2026</strong>.</span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Q. When will the DSSSB Various Post Exam Date exam start?<br></strong><strong>Answer.</strong> DSSSB Various Post exam are scheduled to start from <strong data-start=\"620\" data-end=\"643\">01 June 2026</strong> onwards. </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Q. From which website can I download the DSSSB Various Post Admit Card 2026?<br></strong><strong>Answer. </strong>From the DSSSB recruitment portal: <strong data-start=\"798\" data-end=\"823\">dsssb.delhi.gov.in</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Q. What credentials are needed to download DSSSB Various Post Admit Card 2026?<br></strong><strong>Answer.</strong> You need your <strong data-start=\"944\" data-end=\"970\">Registration Number/ID</strong> and <strong data-start=\"975\" data-end=\"987\">Password</strong> (or sometimes Date of Birth) to log in and download the DSSSB Various Post Admit Card Admit Card 2025.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Q. What details are printed on the DSSSB Various Post Admit Card?<br></strong><strong>Answer. </strong>The admit card includes candidate’s name, roll/registration number, exam centre address, reporting time, exam date, instructions, maybe photograph/signature etc.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Q. What to carry to the test centre?<br></strong><strong>Answer. </strong>Printed admit card + valid photo ID (Aadhaar, Voter ID, Driving Licence etc). Also follow instructions mentioned in the admit card.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Q. What is DSSSB Official Website?<br></strong><strong>Answer. </strong>The Official Website of DSSSB is https://dsssb.delhi.gov.in/</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 1.34953%;\">&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n",
